# These never get deployed at all — the cleanest equivalent of the old Netlify
# _redirects rule that blocked README.txt / version.txt / *.sql from being served.
# (Vercel rewrites can't fake a 404 status the way Netlify's "404!" flag did, so
# "don't ship the file" is the correct fix, not a rewrite trick.)
README.txt
version.txt
*.sql
netlify.toml
netlify/
_redirects
MOBILE-REDIRECT-SETUP.md
